    "scenesThatPass": [
      "LINDSEY: Com-check, everybody. Flatbed, you on line?\nONE NIGHT: Ten-four, Lindsey, read you loud and clear.\nLINDSEY: Cab Three?",
      "LINDSEY: Going over the wall. Coming to bearing 065. Everybody stay tight and in sight.\nONE NIGHT: Starting out descent. Divers, how're you doing?",
      "LINDSEY: Yeah? Well I'm not.\nONE NIGHT: Right through the brainpan. Deader'n dogshit, boss.",
      "ONE NIGHT: No way that could just be seawater.\nLINDSEY: They must've learned how to control water... I mean at a molecular level. They can plasticize it, polymerize it... whatever. Put it under in…",
      "ONE NIGHT: You think they're from down there originally? Or from... you know.\nLINDSEY: I think they're from 'you know'. Some place that has similar conditions... cold, intense pressure. No light."
    ]
  },
